language 0.1.0
module diagnostics
  means
    Findings a tool states about the input it has processed: what was found,
    how heavily it weighs, and in what form the findings of one processing
    are presented together.

entity check : thing
  means
    check: a rule applied to an input and capable of yielding a finding
    about it.

entity diagnostic : thing
  means
    diagnostic: a single finding about an input, tied to the place it
    concerns.

entity severity : thing
  means
    severity: the weight of a diagnostic, by which it is decided whether the
    input is accepted.

entity message : thing
  means
    message: the wording in which a diagnostic states what was found.

entity report : thing
  means
    report: the diagnostics of one processing, presented together.

entity summary : thing
  means
    summary: the counted outcome of one processing, stated apart from the
    findings themselves.
